  Lines:
  - AudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8a40ccda7038941b2b4ed9fa4a23992a, type: 3}
    English: A woman died yesterday expressing what little free rights she has.
  - AudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 6213c8779524b4a548a3263fd87b5127, type: 3}
    English: Do not take this lying down.
  - AudioClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a5d343f6e921f45068268dfd6ffba415, type: 3}
    English: Quiet rebellion is the first step in joining the cause.
